{"step_index":157,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:55:42Z","thinking":"The task involves fetching and verifying data for 200 businesses, identified by 10-digit bizno values. The initial step is to fetch data from a specified URL for each bizno. A careful design of this data retrieval and validation process is required.\n\n\nFocusing on data fields, I'll prioritize filling missing information from the Bizno source, particularly for postal codes and masked representative names. When available, user-provided valid data like phone, fax, and email will be retained, and any valid corporation registration numbers from the Bizno source will be added or prioritized. I will validate the fetched data against known patterns and data types.\n\n\nIdentifying data discrepancies between user input and Bizno is critical, flagging closed businesses and missing information like CEOs. Prioritizing data source validation, the process will use available corporate registration numbers and confirm their integrity using a checksum, ensuring personal businesses do not have corporate numbers. Phone and email addresses will be standardized through formatting and regex validation, with homepages checked for correct format and status.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nasync function sleep(ms) {\\n  return new Promise(resolve => setTimeout(resolve, ms));\\n}\\n\\nfunction parseBizno(html, bizno) {\\n  const data = {\\n    bizno,\\n    company: '',\\n    status: '',\\n    statusDesc: '',\\n    ceo: '',\\n    zip: '',\\n    addr: '',\\n    addrJibun: '',\\n    tel: '',\\n    fax: '',\\n    homepage: '',\\n    email: '',\\n    corpNo: '',\\n    entityType: '',\\n    taxType: '',\\n    employees: '',\\n    industry: '',\\n    uptae: '',\\n    catLarge: '',\\n    catMid: '',\\n    catSmall: '',\\n    catDetail: '',\\n    closingMonth: ''\\n  };\\n\\n  const titleMatch = html.match(/<title>(.*?)<\\\\/title>/i);\\n  if (titleMatch) {\\n    data.company = titleMatch[1].trim();\\n  }\\n\\n  const thTdMatches = [...html.matchAll(/<th[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/th>[\\\\s\\\\S]*?<td[^>]*>([\\\\s\\\\S]*?)<\\\\/td>/gi)];\\n  for (const m of thTdMatches) {\\n    const k = m[1].replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\\n    const vRaw = m[2];\\n    const v = vRaw.replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\\n    if (!k) continue;\\n\\n    if (k.includes('사업자 현재 상태')) {\\n      data.statusDesc = v.replace(/\\\\s+/g, ' ');\\n      if (v.includes('폐업')) data.status = '폐업';\\n      else if (v.includes('휴업')) data.status = '휴업';\\n      else if (v.includes('계속')) data.status = '정상';\\n    } else if (k === '대표자명') {\\n      const cleanCeo = v.replace(/\\\\(※.*?\\\\)/g, '').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').trim();\\n      if (cleanCeo && cleanCeo !== '-') data.ceo = cleanCeo;\\n    } else if (k === '우편번호') {\\n      const cleanZip = v.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n      if (cleanZip.length === 5) data.zip = cleanZip;\\n    } else if (k === '회사주소') {\\n      const lines = vRaw.replace(/<br\\\\s*\\\\/?>/gi, '\\\\n').replace(/<[^>]+>/g, '').split('\\\\n').map(l => l.trim()).filter(l => l);\\n      if (lines.length > 0) data.addr = lines[0];\\n      if (lines.length > 1) data.addrJibun = lines[1];\\n      if (!data.addr && v) data.addr = v;\\n    } else if (k === '전화번호') {\\n      if (v && v !== '-' && !v.includes('비공개'))\n<truncated 4126 bytes>","Description":"\"Script to fetch and parse 200 businesses from bizno\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\verify_and_update_db\\\\fetch_200_bizno.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating fetch script\"","toolSummary":"\"Write fetch_200_bizno.js\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
