{"step_index":187,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-30T01:58:10Z","thinking":"Initial mapping suggests \"온라인공동물류\" (Online Joint Logistics) aligns with the \"Logistics\" or \"Supply Chain\" category. \"글로벌쇼핑몰입점판매\" (Global Shopping Mall Entry Sales) could map to \"E-commerce\" or \"Retail.\" Considering \"자사몰\" (Own Mall) leans toward \"E-commerce\" or a more specific \"Direct-to-Consumer\" category.\n\n\nMany entries appear to relate to e-commerce or cross-border e-commerce activities. Examining \"온라인공동물류\" suggests logistics or supply chain categorization, potentially also fitting within wholesale or retail, depending on the scope. \"글로벌쇼핑몰입점판매\" and \"자사몰진출\" both indicate e-commerce retail activities, likely within the wholesale/retail category. The dataset requires thorough review and refinement of the 200 rows. Specifically, the \"비고 (상태)\" needs validation against external data sources to correctly mark statuses like \"폐업\" or \"휴업\". Company names must be cleaned by removing suffixes.\n\n\nCompany names require cleaning by removing suffixes to maintain a consistent format. The representative field needs unmasking of obscured names, cross-referencing against available data. Address information requires extraction of postal codes, and potential validation against external databases. Telephone and fax numbers need formatting, verification, and deduplication if necessary. Website URLs need validation for valid formatting.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"const fs = require('fs');\\n\\nconst rawInput = fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/input_user_raw.txt', 'utf-8');\\nconst inputLines = rawInput.trim().split('\\\\n').filter(l => l.trim().length > 0);\\nconst biznoData = JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('C:/Users/lg/.gemini/antigravity/worktrees/resilient-bardeen/verify_and_update_db/bizno_200_raw.json', 'utf-8'));\\n\\nfunction formatPhone(phone) {\\n  if (!phone || typeof phone !== 'string') return '';\\n  phone = phone.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n  if (!phone || phone.length < 8) return '';\\n  \\n  if (phone.startsWith('02')) {\\n    if (phone.length === 9) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{2})(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n    if (phone.length === 10) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{2})(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n  } else if (phone.startsWith('0507') || phone.startsWith('0504') || phone.startsWith('0505') || phone.startsWith('0502') || phone.startsWith('070') || phone.startsWith('010')) {\\n    if (phone.length === 11) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{3,4})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n    if (phone.length === 12) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n    if (phone.length === 10) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n  } else {\\n    if (phone.length === 10) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n    if (phone.length === 11) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{3})(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2-$3');\\n    if (phone.length === 8) return phone.replace(/(\\\\d{4})(\\\\d{4})/, '$1-$2');\\n  }\\n  return phone;\\n}\\n\\nfunction isValidCorpNo(corpNo) {\\n  if (!corpNo) return false;\\n  const clean = corpNo.replace(/[^0-9]/g, '');\\n  if (clean.length !== 13) return false;\\n  const weights = [1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2, 1, 2];\\n  let sum = 0;\\n  for (let i = 0; i < 12; i++) {\\n    sum += Number(clean[i]) * weights[i];\\n  }\\n  const remainder = sum % 10;\\n  const checkDigit = (10 - remainder) % 10;\\n  return Number(clean[12]) === checkDigit;\\n}\\n\\n// Category fallback dictionary\\nconst\n<truncated 13157 bytes>","Description":"\"Build verified dataset script\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\worktrees\\\\resilient-bardeen\\\\verify_and_update_db\\\\build_verified_dataset.js\"","toolAction":"\"Creating build script\"","toolSumma